*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*1 [[The Thrillerz]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
